Registration runs Greedy through @neurodesk/greedy (Apache-2.0; see packages/greedy/NOTICE).
Methods implemented from published literature:
- Greedy registration (NMI rigid, affine and stationary velocity field deformable):
  Yushkevich PA et al. Fast automatic segmentation of hippocampal subfields and medial
  temporal lobe subregions in 3 Tesla and 7 Tesla T2-weighted MRI. Alzheimers Dement. 2016.
- Colour deconvolution (H&E, DAB):
  Ruifrok AC, Johnston DA. Quantification of histochemical staining by color deconvolution.
  Anal Quant Cytol Histol. 2001;23(4):291-299.
